SN Phone Checker v1.1

Asks for the last four digits of their data phone number.  If they
don't enter it right after three times, they're outta there.

Quick & Easy Installation:

 1  Place it somewhere.  (PFiles: would be good.)

 2  Bring up bbstext in your favorite editor, edit line #41, adding the
    following line IN FRONT OF EVERYTHING ELSE:

    {#0PFiles:SN_PhoneChecker}
    ^
    CTRL-Q

 3  Reload your bbstext/bbsmenu via CNet's Control Panel menu (option
    #3, "Text/menu reload  RAmiga-T" and you're all set!

 4  Now everytime someone logs on, in addition to their password, they'll
    get their data phone number checked.

(This sucker wasn't big enough to deserve it's own .guide, installer, icons,
help file, blah blah blah plus tax...)

